      "value": "@{63f2ff3ae87fb64515e2e34e|full_name}: interestingly enough i was recommended a video on YouTube comparing unity with unreal, and the video ended with the advice to not be a video game engine fanboy. Both engines have thier strengths.\n\nWhere VRChat has issues with performance, I think a good amount of the trouble is going to be a lack of \"levels of detail\" and also a lack of performance standards. 310k poly and 37 material for an avi? Any shipping game would cut that down.\n\nAre there any similar platforms using UE5? I haven't attempted exhaustive search, but I'm not aware of anything using UE5.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
